3.2. Conveyance of Contributor Versions

A Contributor may deliver the Covered Software to the public in any
form.

3.3. Correspondence Source

A Contributor must keep the Source Code Form of its Contributions
available to the public for at least three years from the date the
Contribution was first made available, or until it no longer provides
support for the Covered Software.

3.4. Files

In the event a third party object code file is a "file" under this
License, You must have permission to use that file in the manner
described in this License.

